{"id":12,"name":"butterfree","speciesId":12,"dex":12,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["bug","flying"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":45,"defense":50,"special-attack":90,"special-defense":80,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"compound-eyes","hidden":false},{"name":"tinted-lens","hidden":true}],"height":11,"weight":320,"baseExp":178,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/12.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/12.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/12.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/12.ogg","genus":"Butterfly Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Borboleta","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"In battle, it flaps its wings at high speed to release highly toxic dust into the air."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Its wings, covered with poisonous powders, repel water. This allows it to fly in the rain."},{"version":"gold","text":"It collects honey every day. It rubs honey onto the hairs on its legs to carry it back to its nest."},{"version":"silver","text":"Water-repellent powder on its wings enables it to collect honey, even in the heav­ iest of rains."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It flits from flower to flower, collecting honey. It can even identify distant flowers in bloom."},{"version":"ruby","text":"BUTTERFREE has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can even search out, extract, and carry honey from flowers that are blooming over six miles from its nest."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can seek, extract, and carry honey from flowers blooming over six miles away."},{"version":"firered","text":"The wings are protected by rain-repellent dust. As a result, this POKéMON can fly about even in rain."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"In battle, it flaps its wings at great speed to release highly toxic dust into the air."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Water-repellent powder on its wings enables it to collect honey, even in the heaviest of rains."},{"version":"y","text":"The wings are protected by rain-repellent dust. As a result, this Pokémon can fly about even in rain."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Butterfree has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can even search out, extract, and carry honey from flowers that are blooming over six miles from its nest."},{"version":"sun","text":"Close examination of its large eyes reveals that each eye is composed of a myriad of tiny eyes."},{"version":"moon","text":"When attacked by other Pokémon, it defends itself by scattering its poisonous scales and fluttering its wings."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its wings are covered in toxic scales. If it finds bird Pokémon going after Caterpie, Butterfree sprinkles its scales on them to drive them off."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Nectar from pretty flowers is its favorite food. In fields of flowers, it has heated battles with Cutiefly for territory."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its wings, covered with poisonous powder, repel water. This allows it to fly in the rain."}],"flavorPt":"Suas asas, cobertas de pó venenoso, repelem a água. Isso permite que ele voe na chuva.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["bug"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"caterpie","speciesId":10,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 7"],"species":"metapod","speciesId":11,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 10"],"species":"butterfree","speciesId":12,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":12,"name":"butterfree","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-a